          "filename": "Devil's Slide (Detail) (5212594403).jpg",
          "caption": "Taken a bit beyond the previous picture and zoomed in, we can see that where all  the construction equipment is assembled, the road appears to fork off into the hillside - entering what looks like a tunnel.\n\nThis is the future route - taxpayers voted for the tunnel some years ago, but it isn't complete yet. It will allow the coast road to completely bypass Devil's Slide - solving the problem once and for all. (We hope...)",
